      Field          Type                        Description                    
 ──────────────── ─────────── ───────────────────────────────────────────────── 
 [2mpath[0m             string      Worktree path                                     
 [2mmain[0m             boolean     Is the main worktree                              
 [2mcurrent[0m          boolean     Is the worktree the command ran from              
 [2mprevious[0m         boolean     Is the previous worktree ([2mwt switch -[0m)            
 [2mdetached[0m         boolean     HEAD is detached                                  
 [2mlocked[0m           object      [2m{reason}[0m; absent when not locked                  
 [2mprunable[0m         object      [2m{reason}[0m; absent when git doesn't report the      
                              worktree prunable                                 
 [2mbranch_mismatch[0m  boolean     Worktree isn't at the path its branch implies     
 [2mduplicate_branch[0m boolean     Another worktree has the same branch checked out  
 [2moperation[0m        string/null In-progress operation: [2m"merge"[0m, [2m"rebase"[0m,         
                              [2m"cherry_pick"[0m, [2m"revert"[0m, [2m"bisect"[0m; absent when    
                              none                                              
 [2mchanges[0m          object/null Working-tree state (see changes object)           

[32mchanges object[0m

The five change flags map to the Working tree symbols ([2mrenamed[0m and [2mdeleted[0m have 
none of their own):

   Field        Type                   Description               
 ────────── ──────────── ─────────────────────────────────────── 
 [2mstaged[0m     boolean      Has staged files                        
 [2mmodified[0m   boolean      Has modified files (unstaged)           
 [2muntracked[0m  boolean      Has untracked files                     
 [2mrenamed[0m    boolean      Has renamed files                       
 [2mdeleted[0m    boolean      Has deleted files                       
 [2mconflicted[0m boolean/null Tracked files carry merge conflicts     
 [2mdiff[0m       object/null  Lines changed vs HEAD: [2m{added, deleted}[0m 

