 [2mbehind[0m   number/null Commits behind the default branch (null for orphans)      
 [2mdiff[0m     object/null Lines changed vs the default branch: [2m{added, deleted}[0m     
 [2morphan[0m   boolean/nul No common ancestor with the default branch                
          l                                                                     
 [2mintegrat[0m object/null [2m{reason}[0m — which check found the content integrated (see  
 [2mion[0m                  integration reasons); absent when determined              
                      not-integrated, null when a dirty tree skipped the checks 
 [2mmerge_co[0m boolean/nul Merging into the default branch would conflict, simulated 
 [2mnflicts[0m  l           locally with [2mgit merge-tree[0m                               

