[2mpr[0m and [2mchecks[0m reports them: a fetch error ([2m⚠[0m) makes both null, no CI leaves 
[2mchecks[0m absent, and merge conflicts leave [2mchecks.status[0m null with [2mpr.mergeable[0m 
false.

